---
/** Placed in articles only where personalization is naturally the next step. */
---
<aside class="checkup-cta">
  <h2>Want help understanding your own situation?</h2>
  <p>The Financial Options Checkup asks a few basic questions and helps you see which options may be worth exploring, including whether bankruptcy makes sense for you. It is being built now.</p>
  <a href="/checkup" class="btn btn-secondary">About the Checkup</a>
</aside>
<style>
  .checkup-cta { background: var(--off); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: var(--space-4) !important; border: 1px solid var(--rule) !important;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding: var(--space-4) 0;
    margin: var(--space-5) 0;
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }
  .checkup-cta h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .checkup-cta p { color: var(--fg-soft); }
</style>
